{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context\nThis workstream has five leaves and 56 distinct file-impact paths under `scripts/`. Every path maps to one retired per-file audit ticket. This story makes no repository edits.\n\n## Plan\n- Complete all five leaves using their exact Scope and file-impact manifests.\n- Each leaf edits only allowlisted prose, preserves behavior-bearing text, runs its recorded checks, and obtains its required non-author semantic-review TSV.\n- At story completion, derive two sorted TSVs from the live children and their net-active `replacement -supersedes-> retired source` links.\n- Migration TSV (56 rows): `path<TAB>replacement-leaf-alias<TAB>source-ticket-alias<TAB>scope-count<TAB>file-impact-count`.\n- Execution TSV (56 rows): `path<TAB>replacement-leaf-alias<TAB>scope-count<TAB>file-impact-count<TAB>source-count`.\n- Store both TSVs in a dedicated `session_log` linked `relates_to` this story. Record each row count and SHA-256 in the completion comment.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] All five child leaves are closed.\n- [ ] The migration TSV contains exactly 56 rows.\n- [ ] The migration TSV contains exactly 56 distinct audited paths.\n- [ ] The migration TSV contains exactly 56 distinct retired source tickets.\n- [ ] Every retired source ticket has exactly one live replacement leaf.\n- [ ] Every migration row has `scope-count=1`.\n- [ ] Every migration row has `file-impact-count=1`.\n- [ ] The execution TSV contains exactly 56 rows.\n- [ ] The execution TSV contains exactly 56 distinct paths.\n- [ ] Every execution row has `scope-count=1`.\n- [ ] Every execution row has `file-impact-count=1`.\n- [ ] Every execution row has `source-count=1`.\n- [ ] Every migrated Scope constraint has a non-author `semantic-preservation=PASS` row with immutable before/final citations.\n- [ ] Every migrated consumer contract has a non-author `semantic-preservation=PASS` row with immutable before/final citations.\n- [ ] Every edited prose block has a non-author `bloat-removal=PASS` row.\n- [ ] Every recorded leaf verification command exits 0 at its cited commit.\n- [ ] The story log records each leaf commit, command result, and reviewer-log id.\n- [ ] The completion comment cites the story session-log id.\n- [ ] The completion comment records both row counts and both TSV SHA-256 values.\n\n## Completion boundary\nClose this story only after every child is closed and both inventories pass these checks."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788667207938226001,"uuid":"2b5040e7-576a-4ac5-be30-402857cb9a7a"}